  "_comment": "Announcer voice-line manifest for JustaLittleFun Racing. Three layers: (1) 'lines' = generic per-event takes, chosen at random; the fallback layer and the only layer needed for events that don't name a horse. (2) 'horseLines' = optional personalised takes keyed by event then by horse-slug (the horse's name lowercased with spaces as underscores, e.g. 'Sea Biscuit' -> 'sea_biscuit'); if an entry exists for the current horse it is used, otherwise playback falls back to 'lines'. (3) 'rollCall' = the compositional pre-race roster: for each runner in gate order the announcer plays a 'position' clip (by gate number) then a 'horseName' clip (by horse-slug), so one name clip per horse is reused across every position. All paths are relative to basePath. Missing files stay silent and never block the game. _comment keys are ignored by the loader.",
